Package: com.local.glassfolderstest3
Name: GlassFolders
Version: 0.7.4~beta4.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Beta 4.6 finalizes the settings layout with independent Folder and App Library toggles, a compact Folder style/strength section, and one App Library style selector. App Library preset controls are removed from the UI and locked internally to the accepted Clear Apple Bright and Liquid Glass Crystal baselines. Existing visual optics are unchanged.
